## 🛠 Tech Stack & Architecture
* **Frontend**: Flutter / Dart with `confetti`, `fl_chart`, and custom gradient themes
* **Monetization Engine**: RevenueCat SDK (`purchases_flutter`)
* **Backend API**: Python REST API on Azure Web Apps (`https://packslight-eefpgge5hdh9befs.eastus-01.azurewebsites.net`)
* **AI Model**: Gemini 3 Flash structured roadmap generators

---

## 📂 Project Structure
```text
packlight/
├── android/               # Native Android configuration
├── ios/                   # Native iOS configuration
├── lib/
│   ├── main.dart          # Entry point, streak checker, RevenueCat setup
│   ├── models/            # Dream, MicroAction, Challenge, Win, UserSession
│   ├── services/          # ApiService (Dream plan generation, challenges, Azure backend)
│   └── screens/           # HomeScreen, DreamsScreen, ChallengesScreen, TrackScreen, UpgradeScreen
├── azure_pack/            # Azure cloud services
│   ├── app.py             # REST API
│   ├── packslight.db      # SQLite database
│   └── requirements.txt   # Dependencies
└── pubspec.yaml           # Flutter dependencies
```

---

## ⚙️ Getting Started
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Jerryblessed/packslight.git
cd packslight
flutter pub get
flutter run
```

